Title: RNG

Summary: Invisible fixed-FAAA RNG manipulation for English Crystal VC

Description: |
  The player performs every input. The plugin has no menu, HUD, automatic input, reset, or SD log.
  At the Ilex Forest shrine it resolves Celebi's direct RNG reads to shiny DVs FAAA, then becomes inert.
  Supports Old 3DS/2DS at 268 MHz and New 3DS/2DS at 268 or 804 MHz.

Compatibility: Any
MemorySize: 5MiB
